    "chunk_text": "This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Ref.No. : KA/LAND/04/141/RDA-2018/53.\n\nLand Ministry's No: 4-3/6/2016/HW/445.\n\nI hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquirethe following lands which are required for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the Land to be Acquired:\n\nLot Nos. 1-73(Lots 73) allotments in Total Extent of about0.2682 Hectare,of land in Preliminary Plan No. CO 9803 anddated 14.06.2019 prepared by the Senior - Superintendent ofSurveyor of Colombo District on behalf of the SurveyorGeneral, situated in the village of Kothalawala, Bomiriya, inthe Grama Niladhari Divisions of 473A, Kaduwela, in theDivisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kaduwela in ColomboDistrict in the Western Province.\n\nG 31097 - 17 (2019/09)\n\n01. Lot No. 1Name of land: Assmt. No. 205, Avissawella Road;Description: Garden, Contain a part of Permanent Building;Claimant: State; Original Claimant: W.M. Wickckramasinghe,No. 660/1, Avissawella Road, Kaduwela ( To finalise the landacquisition); Extent: 0.0050 Hectare.\n\n02. Lot No. 2Name of land: Assmt. No. 197, Avissawella Road;Description: Garden; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: D.Sena, No. 680, Avissawella Road, Kaduwela ( To finalise theland acquisition); Extent: 0.0025 Hectare.\n\n03. Lot No. 3Name of land: Assmt. No. 203, Avissawella Road;Description: Garden; Claimant: State; Original Claimant:A.M.N. Fareena, No. 660, Avissawella Road, Kaduwela ( Tofinalise the land acquisition); Extent: 0.0051 Hectare.\n\nwxl 2142$68 - 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be ui 26 jeks n%yiam;skaod - 2019'09'26\n\nNo. 2142/68 \u2013 THURSDAY, SEPTEMBER 26, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc