    "chunk_text": "w;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2142$69 - 2019 iema;e\u00efn\u00be ui 26 jeks n%yiam;skaod - 2019'09'26\n\nNo. 2142/69 - THURSDAY, SEPTEMBER 26, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.1A - PG 004657 - 382 (2019/09)\n\nSTRATEGIC DEVELOPMENT PROJECTS ACT, No. 14 OF 2008\n\nOrder under Sub section (4) of Section 3\n\nBY Virtue of the powers vested in me by Sub section (4) of Section 3 of the Strategic Development Projects Act, No. 14 of 2008as amended, I, Malik Samarawickrama, Minister of Development Strategies and International Trade, being the Minister incharge of the subject of Investment Promotion, further to the Order published under Sub section (4) of Section 3 underGazette Extraordinary No. 1714/3 dated 11th July, 2011, as amended by the subsequent Order published under Sub-section(4) of Section 3 under Gazette Extraordinary No. 1974/15 dated 05th July, 2016, do by this Order declare that,-\n\nClause (4) of the Order published under Gazette Extraordinary No. 1714/3 dated 11th July, 2011, as amended by thesubsequent Order published under sub-Section (4) of Section 3 under Gazette Extraordinary No. 1974/15 dated 05th July,2016, is hereby further amended to read as follows in order to extend the time granted to implement the Project :-\n\n\"(4) The aforesaid \"project to construct a luxury hotel as Mixed Use Complex Including High Quality Residencies anda High - End Shopping Mall, in Fort, Colombo 01, in the Western Province\" shall commence commercial operation on30th June, 2020\".\n\nMALIK SAMARAWICKRAMA,Minister of Development strategies and International Trade.\n\nColombo, 23rd September, 2019.\n\n10 - 370"
