    "chunk_text": "26.No person shall donate or distribute anything for charity either by cash or by any other means within the camp areaexcept in a place reserved or provided for begging and solicitation for charity under regulation 7.\n\n28.No person shall unduly alter or remove any notice or name board displayed in any place under regulation 7 or 10.\n\n29.It shall be lawful for the District Secretary/ Government Agent, Medical Officer, Public Health Inspector or anyPolice Officer to,\n\n(a) Enter any land or place within the camp area for the purpose of carrying out any regulation from\n\namong these regulations and,\n\n(b) To construct or erect a post in any land or place within the camp area for the purpose of displaying a\n\nnotice or a name board under regulation 7.\n\n30.It shall be lawful for the District Secretary/ Government Agent to cancel the following at any time if he considersthat the cancellation is appropriate or it is for the benefit in the public interest.\n\n(a)Any permission given under regulation 06 or regulation 27.(b)Permit issued under regulation 09.(c)Any license issued under regulation 15.\n\nSchedule\n\nThe margins of the land which belongs to Sri Kshethrarama Purana Viharaya, which is situated in Grama Niladari\u2019s Divisionin No. 200A, Meda Keembiya East, Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Baddegama, Galle District, are indicated as follows:\n\nNorth:Keembikanda\n\nSouth :Jayanthi Junction\n\nEast:Mabotuwana\n\nWest:Thalagaha Junction\n\n10 - 536\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
