    "chunk_text": "LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nMy No.: 4-3/1 (Appointment - Acquisition) Volume V\n\nHON. Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms, has appointed the below named officer in terms of the provisions of theLand Acquisition Act, as an Acquiring Officer for land acquisition activities to function under the directives of the DivisionalSecretary concerned.\n\nSchedule\n\nName of the OfficerDivisional Secretary's DivisionDuration\n\nMr. Dilum Dayarathne (Assistant DivisionalSuriyawewa Divisional SecretariatFrom 01.10.2019 to 30.09.2020 Secretary, Suriyawewa)\n\nW. H. KARUNARATHNE,\n\nSecretary,Ministry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms.\n\nMinistry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,\"Mihikatha Medura\", 1200/6,Rajamalwatta Avenue, Battaramulla,28th September, 2019.\n\n10 - 549\n\nwxl 2143$23 - 2019 Tlaf;dan\u00be ui 02 jeks nodod - 2019'10'02\n\nNo. 2143/23 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, OCTOBER 02, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\n1A - G 31153 - 17 (10/2019)This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\nPART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
