    "chunk_text": "wxl 2143$59 - 2019 Tlaf;dan\u00be ui 04 jeks isl=rdod - 2019'10'04\n\nNo. 2143/59 \u2013 FRIDAY, OCTOBER 04, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\nG 31185 - 22 (10/2019)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nRef. No.: MLB/LND/LNDAQ/L1/52.Land Ministry's Ref. No.: 4-3/9/2017/WS/378.\n\nIT is hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the LandAcquisition (amendment) Act No. 28 of 1964 that theGovernment intended to acquire the following land or servitudewhich is required for a public purpose.\n\nBelow mentioned additional part of a land depicted as LotNo. 01 in Plan No. PP/MR/2809, situated in the Village ofKatuwangoda, in Malimbada Divisional Secretariat Division,in Matara District, in Southern Province was acquired for the\n\nconstruction of the \"Thuluman Linda\" and water pump houseunder the Matara 4th step of water supply scheme.\n\nSchedule\n\n01. Lot No. 01Name of the Land: Hettigewatta; Description of the Land:Home Garden; Original Claimant of the Land: D. G. RupikaDamayanthi; Extent of the Land: 0.0308 Hectare.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on whicha Land/Servitude is to be acquired personally or by agentduly authorized in writing, before me at Malimbada DivisionalSecretariat on the 27th October, 2019 at 10.30 a.m. and arehereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on orbefore 17th day of October, 2019 the nature of their interest in\n\nIII fldgi - Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'10'04PART III - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 04.10.20192A\n\nthe land/servitude the amount of compensation and the detailsof the compensation of such amount."
